Package: wmhelpers
Title: WildMon Ecological Workflow Helper Functions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    c(
        person("Jose W.", "Ribeiro Jr.", email = "josewribeiro@wildmon.ai", role = c("aut", "cre")),
        person("Thiago", "Bicudo", email = "thiago@wildmon.ai", role = "aut")
    )
Description: 
    Internal WildMon (WM) R package providing helper functions to 
    standardize ecological data workflows. Includes utilities for 
    reading and harmonizing project tracking data, generating 
    standardized visualizations, coalescing multi-method datasets, 
    validating detection arrays, and supporting multi-species 
    occupancy modeling (MSOM) workflows, including prediction, 
    visualization, and export of model outputs.
